{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1000_p", "source_sha256": "76afa61b9613ab01cdc2499959746c2f97049f97cb4328dc321b937811dd3bbd", "ja": "（ステージの幕が下りても歓声が鳴りやまない……。\n今日の美希たちのライブは大成功だったな！）", "zh": "（表演落幕后，欢呼声也没停歇……\n美希她们今天的演唱会圆满成功！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "10b6b3d5f58b88552117f132e1f4498fc67a516414d0123f64fb41072290d68d", "ja": "はあ、はあ……。{$P$}～～～！　\nただいまなの～～！", "zh": "呼、呼……{$P$}～～～！\n美希回来了唷～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1002_p", "source_sha256": "63847de5b5b0cf9072dcc9ddbac5b3c89df7cab04e5f3da7ae030ed36df044f0", "ja": "おかえり、美希。ライブお疲れ様！\nいいステージだったぞ！", "zh": "欢迎回来，美希，演唱会辛苦了！\n这场表演很棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "52cb9614c355891210804ec8c6d344d303b2ee49cb1459fb9785fd83a3acc698", "ja": "うんっ、今日はミキ、すっごくがんばったの！\nヒューヒュー、さすがミキ。えら～い♪", "zh": "嗯，今天美希非常努力了！\n咻──咻──不愧是美希，真了～不起♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "3ee1b88fb74a15a4e5add88008bf10181dbf21cfccb4b52cbcdf8f2cee6edfee", "ja": "ねっ、こんなえらいミキには、\nがんばったゴホウビ、あげた方がいいって思うな☆", "zh": "欸，美希这么了不起，\n美希觉得你应该给美希努力过后的奖励呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9254114985c0f28df512db3e50db38af0857e2a3cd2c8f4f231ceec16835c75d", "ja": "まあ、たまにはいいか……。\nそれで美希は、どんなゴホウビがいいんだ？", "zh": "好吧，偶尔犒赏你也无妨……\n那美希你想要怎样的奖励？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "727fcb35d64d6b9020c484245e8812397d9e64fa1ed0c0af213c5e6645b685cf", "ja": "やったやったやった～！\nじゃあミキ、デートがいいな♪", "zh": "万岁万岁万岁～！\n那么，美希想要去约会♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "55e64c76729d0e6e3ce847342f8d2a0f05c04ccb298b9b6b7ae4fd121d9f5a36", "ja": "この前の公園もいいけど、\n今度はもう少しいい雰囲気のトコがいいってカンジ！", "zh": "虽然上次去公园也很棒，\n但这次想去气氛更好一点的地方说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "dcb1bde3ad5a7e593295a8dedc626bdcb939aeb251c3b87f458357c667cdfdc9", "ja": "キレイな夜景を見ながら、いっしょにご飯とかー。\nあっ、南の島とかいいかも♪", "zh": "比如欣赏着美丽夜景一起吃饭之类的──\n啊，或许去南方小岛也不错♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "0af7b8db7ff8eed99aaf5228edd5c9462369acfec3fa5169ab1e7fb89909f323", "ja": "浜辺で夕日をながめながら、これからのこと\n話し合うの。それで、その後は～～。あはっ☆", "zh": "在海边眺望着夕阳讨论将来。\n然后，之后就～～啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1010_p", "source_sha256": "957715284d55b7782bcc307058be816be028f63e952d4031791e779f1d1a0f3e", "ja": "あはっ☆じゃないっ。そんな豪勢なゴホウビは、\n美希がもっと頑張ってくれてから考えるよ。", "zh": "说什么「啊哈☆」啊。\n这么豪华的奖励，要等美希你更努力一点再考虑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "ded471f01ab6022d07a9f42d953117abf23fd3db22cfbc0c4e9f528bcd3afd05", "ja": "むー。もっとって、どのくらい？\n10m走るくらい？", "zh": "哼──更努力是多努力？\n大概跑个十公尺？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4e76883eccbe205b249734ac19c4e397ef7db550d22518d9701c5fb27a43a598", "ja": "短い！　トップアイドルになれるくらいかな。\nとにかく今回は、この場であげられるゴホウビで頼む。", "zh": "好短！大概要等你成为顶尖偶像吧。\n总之这次就麻烦你换一个可以当场给的奖励。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "77a59b55ce3e3e053ce67710c815ea80f93cbd582bc3e908d1f301ea781ed9e7", "ja": "この場で～？\nうーん、それなら～……。", "zh": "可以当场给的～？\n嗯──既然这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "6291613bf4ce0c4645bab01b54fe4d99ca9b5909e57ba53ab30875a60fc2dc61", "ja": "そうだ！　ねえねえ、{$P$}。\n目、つぶってくれる？", "zh": "对了！欸欸，{$P$}，\n你可以闭上眼睛吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1015_p", "source_sha256": "bb024a927c23513630cd0536cdad73c242a1813d12d213336e618d6ae64e3ab1", "ja": "目を？　それが美希のゴホウビになるのか？", "zh": "闭上眼睛？这能当作给你的奖励吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "984d02153bb397f39b6f8136ecd22ef4a14f8a0cdb25a64131c7a58e6f6606f8", "ja": "うん♪　さあさあ、とじてとじて！", "zh": "嗯♪快点快点，赶快闭上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c69c389e9c895a3c4f27528dcb738370bf67e6830ad538b9a842f7737dbb9eae", "ja": "わ、わかった。美希がそう言うなら……。", "zh": "我、我知道了，既然美希你这么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1018_p", "source_sha256": "74b16d728a2bac07e0c26fa4c9da07231abe5a4a5e838ac1a3be3df117ddaf4e", "ja": "ほら、閉じたよ。これでいいのか？", "zh": "好了，我闭上了，这样就行了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "05b0052aa693272958a0be0ab7ff0d5e98a5da19f044cf74ea87cf02093fd3e4", "ja": "えへへっ、ちょっと待っててね。\nミキも準備しないと……。あ、あったの！", "zh": "嘿嘿，你先等一下喔。\n美希也要做好准备……啊，找到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "3dc6c3a67d1dab4df5eb8b7ebf72b53f8d34a2ab818772cbadc89851e95b2876", "ja": "それじゃ、心の準備はいーい？\nいくよ、ハニー……♪", "zh": "那么，做好心理准备了吗？\n要开始啰，HONEY……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1021_p", "source_sha256": "213d6634e163cb5468bd96ed5ef68834f2b18a0da82bf2f2b085b3212ca7915b", "ja": "（何か……甘い匂いが近づいてきてるような……。\nそして……美希の息遣いが聞こえて……）", "zh": "（好像……有一股甜香在靠近……\n还有……能听见美希的呼吸声……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1022_p", "source_sha256": "37324209ab0f8809225f0751552816d612ff750936013a29f46c75df59f1e305", "ja": "（って、まさか！？　美希、ちょっと待……！）", "zh": "（等等，该不会是！？美希，等一……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1023_se", "source_sha256": "24e80cfe6b6826358049b737b60d58eea19fab9806327458397bc8d166ed6fd7", "ja": "カシャ！", "zh": "喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1024_003mik", "source_sha256": "58ecbe594edc96764d9c7c1da51a84f86dfaec4b325983429ac8e23e47162966", "ja": "む～、急に動くから写真がぶれちゃったの。\nいいカンジにとれそうだったのに……。", "zh": "唔～你突然乱动，照片都糊掉了。\n本来正感觉能拍出好照片的说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1025_p", "source_sha256": "a655ca9bfc2958bf97e63299f43c49c3729138b4b8dda74a52d1c14ed2078a88", "ja": "えっ？　……あ、ごめん。\nそうか、スマホで俺たちの写真を撮ってたのか。", "zh": "咦？……啊，抱歉。\n这样啊，你在用手机拍我们的合照啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1026_003mik", "source_sha256": "06ac2c07268d57536677d8edde81b159823cfb07269ab0a61e330b6aa57d4250", "ja": "うん、ずっとこういう写真、ほしいなって思ってたの♪\n……もしかして、こういうの、ヤ？", "zh": "嗯，美希一直很想拍这种照片♪\n……难道你不喜欢这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1027_p", "source_sha256": "0d77fb8e9069ffbfd2b0873f431173ee0cfda9321326eafb4a79d93af2296ccd", "ja": "そんなことないよ。写真でよければ喜んで。\nでも、ホントにいいのか？", "zh": "没这回事，如果只是拍照，我很乐意。\n但真的这样就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1028_003mik", "source_sha256": "459562221dd157961ab5a7c3a97bbef172b673871d7ecaa3a0f7e9612ac62555", "ja": "うん♪　ちゃんとしたゴホウビは、\nトップアイドルになってから。でしょ？", "zh": "嗯♪\n正式的奖励要等到成为顶尖偶像再说，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "3a43a13314cdadb419b31dc9254fcd116874bcbf9eac11f115440c10fed8cf91", "ja": "それならミキ、そんなにかからないって思うな♪", "zh": "既然这样，美希觉得应该不会花太多时间呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "754fab320784041b207f881e65d097bbe3bea700ecfc8fbb71ae5aca07985198", "ja": "だから～、もう一枚！　ね、今度は動いちゃダメだよ？\nはい、目を閉じて閉じて！", "zh": "所以～再拍一张！欸，这次你不可以乱动喔。\n好了，快闭上眼睛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1031_p", "source_sha256": "11a2cac18b9388fc4c91a4317e59f9ae3b0f2e74449c940f6b7379547a7f45c8", "ja": "え？　あ、ああ、わかった。", "zh": "咦？呃，好，我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1032_p", "source_sha256": "2d731fe198e38da6a7f3b90f4c4377935a02a2deac133c53cdf838e6869655c2", "ja": "（そういえば、目を閉じた俺の隣で、\n美希は一体何を……？）", "zh": "（话说回来，\n美希到底在闭上眼睛的我旁边做什么……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0094_1033_se", "source_sha256": "24e80cfe6b6826358049b737b60d58eea19fab9806327458397bc8d166ed6fd7", "ja": "カシャ！", "zh": "喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
